@startuml Fine-tuning and Error Classification Process

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> LoadSemanticModel : Start (App Startup)
LoadSemanticModel --> LoadErrorClassifier : Semantic Model Loaded
LoadErrorClassifier --> PreprocessInput : Error Classifier Loaded / Fallback
LoadErrorClassifier --> ErrorState : Model Load Failed
PreprocessInput --> AnalyzeResponse : Input Preprocessed
AnalyzeResponse --> ClassifyErrors : Begin Analysis
ClassifyErrors --> IdentifyConcepts : Errors Classified
IdentifyConcepts --> IdentifySkillGaps : Concepts Identified
IdentifySkillGaps --> OutputResults : Skill Gaps Identified
OutputResults --> [*] : Results Output

' Error/Retry states
LoadErrorClassifier --> Idle : Retry on Failure
ErrorState --> Idle : Manual Intervention / Retry

@enduml 